      "id": "CVE-2026-100303",
      "publishedDate": "2026-09-25T18:47:38.596Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-09-25T18:47:38.596Z",
      "description": "TDuck survey form through 6.0 lacks authorization checks on FormThemeController write endpoints for global form themes and categories. Authenticated non-admin users can add, modify, or delete themes and theme categories affecting forms owned by other users.",
      "severity": 5.4,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：TDuckCloud tduck-survey-form\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/LinYuanyi1/cve-request-poc/blob/adffc39b78cad18cd489cbf7454853bf0f744b7f/tduck/poc_form_theme_write.py",
